WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:13.930
Today my family is going to Chinatown.

2
00:00:13.931 --> 00:00:16.964
It's the Chinese New Year.

3
00:00:16.965 --> 00:00:22.181
So we will see a parade!

4
00:00:22.182 --> 00:00:26.156
First my brother and I spot some sweets.

5
00:00:26.157 --> 00:00:30.533
Mom buys a few for us.

6
00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:36.518
"Mmm!" I say. "Delicious!"

7
00:00:36.519 --> 00:00:41.146
Next we hear some drummers.

8
00:00:41.147 --> 00:00:48.075
We clap when the drummers play Chinese music.

9
00:00:48.076 --> 00:00:53.696
Whoa! Here comes a dancing dragon!

10
00:00:53.697 --> 00:00:56.978
Dad says dragons are special in China.

11
00:00:56.979 --> 00:01:00.881
They bring good luck in the new year.

12
00:01:00.882 --> 00:01:04.943
Then acrobats spin plates round and round.

13
00:01:04.944 --> 00:01:07.980
I worry that one will fall!

14
00:01:07.981 --> 00:01:11.283
But the acrobats are amazing.

15
00:01:11.284 --> 00:01:14.497
They don't drop any plates at all!

16
00:01:14.498 --> 00:01:18.181
Later Chinese lanterns glow in the night.

17
00:01:18.182 --> 00:01:21.185
Mom says they are beautiful.

18
00:01:21.186 --> 00:01:25.501
They're my favorite thing until I see something else.

19
00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:29.512
Fireworks! Boom! Boom!

20
00:01:29.513 --> 00:01:32.922
Bright colors sparkle in the sky.

21
00:01:32.923 --> 00:01:36.577
When it's time to go, I feel sad.

22
00:01:36.578 --> 00:01:40.275
But Dad says we can come back next year.

23
00:01:40.276 --> 00:01:43.341
"Hooray!" I cheer.

24
00:01:43.342 --> 00:01:46.298
"Happy New Year!"
